   "caption": {
    "en": "Kolkata Metro guide for Durga Puja 2026: big pandals within a 20-minute walk of a station 🚇\n\nKumartuli Park is 10 minutes from Sovabazar, Mohammad Ali Park 5 from Central (that's them in the photos, in earlier years). Chaltabagan, Tala Prattoy, Santosh Mitra Square, Shyam Square, FD Block and Behala Notun Dal all have a station close by too: the stations, the walk in minutes and the best time to go are in the free guide (link in bio). Cabs crawl on Saptami night. The Metro doesn't.\n\nSend this to the friend who always says \"let's take an Uber\".",
